# Asset Management Conventions

## Directory Structure

```text
assets/
├── common/             # Shared across all languages (sound, common parts)
└── ja/                 # Japanese (default/master)
    ├── chara/          # Live2D(.model3.json), VRM, FBX, PNG
    ├── bg/             # Background images, HDR
    ├── voice/          # Voice files
    ├── metadata/       # CSV metadata files
    └── image/          # Generic images, CG
```

## Routing Rules

### 1. Shared Resources (`common_` prefix)

- If a script ID has the `common_` prefix, resolve from `assets/common/`.
- Intended for resources shared across languages (sound, UI parts, etc.).

### 2. Localized Resources (no prefix)

- Prioritize `assets/{current_lang}/`.

### 3. Automatic Fallback

- If a resource does not exist in the current language directory, fall back to `assets/ja/`.
- Fallback chain: `assets/{lang}/` -> `assets/ja/`.

## Metadata CSV Format

All metadata must be deserialized type-safely via `serde`. Place CSV files under `assets/{lang}/metadata/`.

### `chara.csv` - Character/Model Management

| Field | Type | Description |
|--------|-----|------|
| `chara_id` | `String` | Unique script-facing ID |
| `type` | `Enum` | `LIVE2D` / `VRM` / `FBX` / `2D_SPRITE` |
| `file_path` | `String` | Base path (routing rules apply) |
| `anchor_x` | `f32` | Display anchor X (0.0-1.0) |
| `anchor_y` | `f32` | Display anchor Y (0.0-1.0) |
| `base_scale` | `f32` | Base scale in Filament space |
| `physics` | `Enum` | `ENABLED` / `DISABLED` (secondary-motion physics) |
| `metadata` | `String` | Path to `.model3.json` or expression definitions |

### `sound.csv` - Audio Management

| Field | Type | Description |
|--------|-----|------|
| `sound_id` | `String` | Script-facing ID |
| `type` | `Enum` | `BGM` / `SE` |
| `file_path` | `String` | File path |
| `volume` | `f32` | Base volume (0.0-1.0) |
| `loop_start` | `f32` | Loop start (seconds), 0 = beginning |
| `loop_end` | `f32` | Loop end (seconds), 0 = end of file |

### `bg.csv` - Background Management

| Field | Type | Description |
|--------|-----|------|
| `bg_id` | `String` | Script-facing ID |
| `type` | `Enum` | `STATIC` / `PANORAMA` / `3D_SCENE` |
| `file_path` | `String` | File path |
| `ibl_intensity` | `f32` | IBL intensity |
| `blur_factor` | `f32` | Blur factor |

### `images.csv` - Event CG/Icon Management

| Field | Type | Description |
|--------|-----|------|
| `image_id` | `String` | Reference ID |
| `file_path` | `String` | File path |
| `category` | `Enum` | `EVENT_CG` / `ITEM_ICON` / `UI` |
| `gallery_unlock` | `bool` | Gallery unlock flag |

### `voices.csv` - Voice Management

| Field | Type | Description |
|--------|-----|------|
| `voice_id` | `String` | Reference ID |
| `file_path` | `String` | Voice file path |
| `subtitle` | `String` | Subtitle text |
| `volume` | `f32` | Per-voice volume (0.0-1.0) |

## Asset Loading Rules

- Assume asynchronous loading (`async fn load_asset()`).
- Manage loaded assets via cache manager.
- Purge unnecessary assets on scene transitions (prevent memory leaks).
- Return `AssetError` on load failure and use fallback image/sound.

## File Naming Rules

- All file names use `snake_case`.
- Manage IDs in metadata CSV; do not auto-generate from file names.
- Keep original extensions (`.model3.json`, `.vrm`, `.fbx`, `.hdr`, etc.).
